    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is57">
        <head xml:id="gom-is57-Hd1e98">Caput 57</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is57-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is57-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is57-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is57_1@1-2">Justus perit.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is57-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-is57-Nd1e110" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e113">Haec referunt Judaei ad Isaiam, qui serra lignea sectus est a Manasse impiissimo rege, et alios prophetas, quos ipse occidit, viros misericordiae. Sed verius hoc de illo dicitur, qui est summe justus.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is57-d1e116">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e118" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is57_1@3-5">Et nemo est.</quote>
            Propter speculatores caecos et canes mutos.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is57-d1e122">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e124" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is57_1@6-7">Qui recogitet:</quote>
            quia caeci et muti ignorantes sapientiam, non cogitant ea quae Dei sunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is57-Dd1e129">
          <head xml:id="gom-is57-Hd1e131">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is57-d1e133">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1299B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e137" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is57_2@1-9">Veniat pax, requiescat in cubili suo, qui ambulavit in.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is57-Rd1e140"><name xml:id="gom-is57-Nd1e141" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e144">Propheta precatur ut Christus veniat, resurgens a mortuis requiescat in cubili in gloria, scilicet paternae majestatis, vel in Ecclesia, in qua in directione ambulavit.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is57-Dd1e148">
          <head xml:id="gom-is57-Hd1e150">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is57-d1e152">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e154" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is57_6@13-13">Libamen.</quote>
            Vinum, oleum et hujusmodi liquores: sacrificium panis, victima et hujusmodi.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is57-Dd1e159">
          <head xml:id="gom-is57-Hd1e161">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is57-d1e163">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e165" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is57_7@1-3">Super montem excelsum.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e168"><seg type="qs">Haeretici quoque</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ut conculcentur ab hominibus.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is57-Dd1e178">
          <head xml:id="gom-is57-Hd1e180">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is57-d1e182">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e184" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is57_8@1-3">Et post ostium:</quote>
            Quasi diceret: Non solum in montibus idola adorasti, sed etiam post ostium posuisti, ut ingrediens videres et semper adorares.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is57-d1e188">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e190" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is57_8@10-13">Quia juxta me discooperuisti.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e193"><seg type="qs">Metaphora adulterae sicut supra meretricis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">omnibus exposita intrantibus.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is57-Dd1e202">
          <head xml:id="gom-is57-Hd1e204">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is57-d1e206">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1299C"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e210" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is57_9@10-11">Misisti legatos.</quote>
            Ut afferrent longinqua idola, quasi non sufficiant vicina. Et in hoc Babylonios et Aegyptios deos significat.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is57-Dd1e215">
          <head xml:id="gom-is57-Hd1e217">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is57-d1e219">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e221" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is57_10@1-5">In multitudine viae tuae laborasti.</quote>
            Qui ambulat via regia non laborat. Una est via veritatis quae dicit: <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e224" source="http://scta.info/resource/io14_6@4-10">Ego sum via, veritas et vita</quote>: Multae sunt viae mundanorum, unde, <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e227" source="http://scta.info/resource/ez18_29@11-22">Non sicut viae meae sunt viae vestrae<!-- check: Migne cites is40; text matches ez18_29 --></quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is57-Dd1e233">
          <head xml:id="gom-is57-Hd1e235">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is57-d1e237">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e239" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is57_13@14-18">Qui autem fiduciam habet mei.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is57-Rd1e242"><name xml:id="gom-is57-Nd1e243" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e246">Qui idola non coluerunt, vel in captivitatem ducti poenituerunt, sub Zorobabel et aliis ducibus reversi, Deum suum in loco suo adoraverunt secundum Hebraeum.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is57-d1e249">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e251" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is57_13@22-24">Possidebit montem sanctum tuum,</quote>
            scilicet legem Veteris et Novi testamenti; utrumque enim in monte <pb ed="#P" n="1299D"/> datum. Et ad praemiorum altitudinem invitat, vel Christum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is57-Dd1e258">
          <head xml:id="gom-is57-Hd1e260">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is57-d1e262">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e264" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is57_14@1-2">Et dicam</quote>
            ego Christus scilicet apostolis, <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e267">Viam feci,</quote> bene praedicando, praebete iter in exemplum eis bene operando; auferte offendicula per baptismum peccata abluendo, idolorum cultum praedicatione amovendo.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is57-Dd1e271">
          <head xml:id="gom-is57-Hd1e273">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is57-d1e275">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e277" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is57_15@1-3">Quia haec dicit.</quote>
            Increpatione contra Jerusalem finita, venit ad eos qui confidunt in Domino, quorum reversioni iter jusserat praeparari. Unde et a laudibus Dei incipit, et quae redeunti populo promiserit, consequenter ostendit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is57-Dd1e283">
          <head xml:id="gom-is57-Hd1e285">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is57-d1e287">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e289" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is57_16@1-5">Non enim in sempiternum litigabo.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is57-Rd1e292"><name xml:id="gom-is57-Nd1e293" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e296">Non in sempiternum servabo iram meam, neque <pb ed="#P" n="1300A"/> causabor cum creatura mea, sed percutiam in praesenti, ut sanem in futuro.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is57-d1e302">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e304" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is57_16@11-12">Quia spiritus.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e307"><seg type="qs">Pax, gaudium, vita omnium</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">specialiter ad Judaeos.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is57-Dd1e316">
          <head xml:id="gom-is57-Hd1e318">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is57-d1e320">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e322" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is57_17">Abscondi a te,</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            etc., scilicet auxilium meum, ut amplius desideres dicens: <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e327" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps79_4@5-10">Ostende faciem tuam, et salvi erimus</quote>.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is57-d1e331">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e333" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is57_17@15-15">Abiit.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is57-Rd1e336"><name xml:id="gom-is57-Nd1e337" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e340">Quod quidam intelligens ait: <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e342" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps37_7@11-14">Tota die contristatus ingrediebar</quote>.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is57-Dd1e348">
          <head xml:id="gom-is57-Hd1e350">Versus 19</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is57-d1e352">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e354" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is57_19@1-1">Creavi:</quote>
            quasi diceret: Liberationem a captivitate, quam per Jeremiam post septuaginta annos promisi, opere complevi
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is57-d1e358">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e360" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is57_19@1-4">Creavi fructum labiorum pacem.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is57-Dd1e365">
          <head xml:id="gom-is57-Hd1e367">Versus 20</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is57-d1e369">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is57-Qd1e371" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is57_20@1-2">Impii autem.</quote>
            Supra de illis qui in captivitate poenitentiam egerunt, et ideo liberati <pb ed="#P" n="1300B"/> sunt, et de illis qui post ascensionem crediderunt. Hic de illis specialiter loquitur, qui in infidelitate sua remanserunt.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
